Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.35,0:00:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真白啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會馬上做完這邊的工作 好想你哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那軟綿綿的 像棉花糖一樣的白雲 真白啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別... 別說了 爸爸真是的 別再這樣子了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經不是小孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過得還好嗎？沒有寂寞吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題 有奶奶在 而且我還交到了新朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 等下次回去 要跟我們介紹哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再跟你視訊了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:40.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 你們工作也要加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好的 再見！ -嗯 再見！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:48.93,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚嗚！嗚嗚！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:54.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖 要喝牛奶嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:57.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:58.67,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:00.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還是要換尿布了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:02.06,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:04.71,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,空... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 難道是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學你懂她想要什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是想見爸爸媽媽了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:16.79,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:18.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣的啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:24.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 可問題是 現在都不知道要怎麼回藍天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:24.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1470,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 也是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:31.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少能夠讓她見到爸爸媽媽的樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有方法可以讓她見到父母
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:38.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-欸？      {\r}-欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用這個 就可以與藍天大地取得聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-欸!?      {\r}-欸!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}嚶嚶啜泣想家家！小空不要哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是幻鏡平板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirror Pad
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.87,0:03:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠映照出心裡在想的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還能與娃娃身處藍天大地的父母通話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:46.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 這邊世界也有很好用的工具啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能！怎麼可能有這種東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶 你究竟是哪來的世外高人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:52.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是藍天人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.03,0:03:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:04:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 奶奶是藍天人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍！藍天人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:09.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 你當真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 我是藍天大地的一位博學家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.67,0:04:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在50年前 來到這邊世界做調研的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說笑的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然跟你們說這些 一下子很難接受的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 最近發生的都不是在做夢 能夠相信我說的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:40.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 你該不會知道送我和小空回藍天大地的方法吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 不過還需要一點時間做準備
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就放心交給我來辦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:49.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 十分感謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 現在你們...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:58.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,為了安慰寂寞的小空 要馬上與藍天大地取得聯絡 沒錯吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信號要傳播到藍天大地 需要大量的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能量源就是這種寶石
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:10.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空石！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:10.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊世界也有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空石是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:18.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是在藍天大地使用的一種礦物 能為各種用途提供動力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都沒有見到過 不是輕易就能找到的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.75,0:05:27.51,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:30.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要找到天空石 讓小空見到爸爸媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:39.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學！我跟你想到一起去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:41.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是天涯海角 都要去闖一闖！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去哪裡才能找到？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼 我們家後山應該就有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-就有的嗎   {\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-就有的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後... 後山嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,出乎意料的近啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:06:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 你的幻鏡筆 會指引出寶石所在的方位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:06:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(735,970)}Mirage Pen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:05.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,既然已經有方向了 我們馬上出發吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:06.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊呀...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:09.71,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:11.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也要一起去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們一起去外面逛逛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 那我去做一下準備
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:19.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就給小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那個的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:23.85,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,吊床穿戴完成！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 由由阿姨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.27,0:06:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個應該會幫到你們大忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這還是來到這邊世界 第一次外出呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:36.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:39.06,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,空空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們記住了 要是遇到什麼問題 就馬上回家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:47.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！我們走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:49.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:55.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嚇我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶居然是藍天人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:04.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼真白同學也有一點藍天人的血統吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從生物學上來講 是的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:08.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,果然...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:12.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 就像由由阿姨說的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:16.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的相遇 可能真的是命運
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:21.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,欸欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:23.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！乖一點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:24.98,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:30.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,希望小空能打起精神來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 給你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.81,0:07:36.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是蓬鬆的(蒲公英)棉絮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:40.76,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不喜歡嗎？那麼這樣呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:52.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:58.41,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空！小空！小空！小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學懂得真多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,逗小空的手法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:07.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 照顧小寶寶的時候 最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:10.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是能判斷出 小寶寶心裡的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:15.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就像剛才 能夠給小空喜歡的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:19.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是因為真白同學有著溫柔的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有... 真的有嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.49,0:08:24.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 我也找點什麼給小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:25.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這... 這是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.85,0:08:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下！那個蘑菇是有毒的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.83,0:08:36.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山裡是會有危險的植物的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是熟悉的東西 不能貿然接觸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:46.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是 真是危險啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家以後 給你看家裡的圖鑑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:53.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 真白同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:56.75,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚 嗚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:08:57.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:09:02.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是肚子餓了吧 剛才都沒有喝牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:13.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,噗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:14.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,吃飽了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:17.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:20.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,來 乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:21.14,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,噗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吃吧 我給小晴準備了麵包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:27.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:34.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！很柔軟！非常好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 我有點擔心能不能烤好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:44.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！這是真白同學烤的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:47.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還會做麵包 太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,而且味道都是職業級的水準了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:52.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:54.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？難道說這個麵包
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是雲彩的形狀嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我試著以藍天大地為印象
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我並不知道... 藍天大地是個怎麼樣的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就取名為雲麵包！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:11.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,雲麵包 嘻嘻嘻！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:15.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 這是雲麵包 軟綿綿的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:17.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,軟綿綿！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:22.58,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:24.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-太好了！  {\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}-太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空 小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶指的 應該就是這條小溪...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:43.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（幻鏡筆提示音）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:47.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,筆發光了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,附近就有天空石了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:54.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 尋寶的時間開始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在這一邊嗎？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:01.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！那個是？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:06.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好... 好厲害！這究竟是誰 又出於什麼目的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 的確是很厲害...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:11.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:12.96,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:14.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:17.08,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該不會在這裡面？我說笑的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.23,0:11:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:33.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,試試看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴你來真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:40.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 有種好厲害的感覺！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地自古相傳的藍天神拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:02.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:06.89,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的劈開了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！化石？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,得教！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}押忍！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:21.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對 雖然是發現了寶貝...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.77,0:12:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也沒有產生什麼反應
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟天空石沒有關係呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:32.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:35.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好強的光...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:39.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！那邊的是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:45.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下就能跟藍天大地通話了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:51.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:56.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:13:00.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！你們嚇到我了 石塔都倒掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:02.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要怎麼賠我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:05.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:06.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤兔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:10.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,老子叫！卡！疤！痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:12.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,都幾次了 該記住了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:14.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.47,0:13:16.10,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:20.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,想要的東西 居然自己送上門來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:22.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好運！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:26.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,把那個小娃娃交給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不給！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:33.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也很不得已啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:36.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:47.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:51.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！去抓到小娃娃！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 你們去躲起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:58.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:04.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看我英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:11.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:11.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:21.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:23.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:23.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:33.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:33.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:41.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:41.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:49.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:49.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:12.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:21.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸 給我上！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:28.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:35.49,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要怕 Cure Sky會保護我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.21,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:49.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,待在地面很危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！好強的力氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:15:59.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:02.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:04.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:05.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:08.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:12.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:14.82,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳！你在搞什麼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:17.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這種東西是打不到我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:31.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,危險！真白同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:38.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:44.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（腳步聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:45.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:50.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！亂亂亂亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:53.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.79,0:16:54.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:58.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳！快點收拾掉她！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:16:59.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:02.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.57,0:17:05.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:06.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:11.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:17.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:17.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:20.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:24.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.80,0:17:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:38.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是叫你收拾掉亂暴獸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:41.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 就用這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:43.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:52.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃 好吃 這下我就氣力炸裂了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.16,0:17:54.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.52,0:17:57.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？你難道要打第2輪？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:00.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:01.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（肚子叫了）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:02.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:07.22,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的！在山裡不能隨便採摘和食用植物的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.39,0:18:08.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以的哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:10.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,壞寶寶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:13.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,給我記住！卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:26.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼... 因為真白同學保護了小空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:29.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我才可以放心去戰鬥的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:33.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:34.94,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:42.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我們快點回去 把天空石交給由由阿姨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:48.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了 由由阿姨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該可以接通了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:09.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？是誰打來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.89,0:19:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通信恢復了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:13.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空看到了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:16.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:20.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:22.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:25.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,和我給她取的名字是一樣的欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該驚訝的不是這個吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.11,0:19:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是公主欸 也就是說小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:33.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是藍天大地的公主嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:35.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:38.93,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:46.70,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.13,0:19:49.98,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有受傷吧？肚子沒餓著吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看樣子應該沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空公主 你沒事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最閃亮的小星星！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 見到了爸爸媽媽 是不是稍微安心了一點？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:22.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:27.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！空空！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.43,0:20:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.23,0:20:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到你很有精神 我們就放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.57,0:20:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,國王陛下 王妃殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在做好回到那邊世界的準備之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主就交給我們來照顧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地的大能耐傳奇·名譽博學家·由由博士！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(775,970)}Hyper ㄋㄥˊㄋㄞˋ Legend
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:51.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-啊！   {\3c&HF348AE&\4c&H000000&}-小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.39,0:20:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通信就要切斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:54.87,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.05,0:20:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空公主 就拜託給
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.95,0:20:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:00.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:05.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:23.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.56,0:21:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴啊 你沒有想家嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:37.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴應該也很想家人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:44.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我還有想要做的事 沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:45.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:51.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 我的身邊還有朋友嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.40,0:21:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.45,0:22:00.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.95,0:22:04.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（嬉笑聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:09.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8A68FF&\4c&H865FEC&}今天是我  Cure Precious！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:09.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8A68FF&\4c&H865FEC&\pos(1095,970)}{\fs50}珍奇愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:12.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8A68FF&\4c&H865FEC&}大家來一起 美味微笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:12.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8A68FF&\4c&H865FEC&\pos(1100,970)}{\fs50}Delicious Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.11,0:23:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空啊 你長大了 想要做什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.41,0:23:50.13,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.31,0:23:52.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要成為英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.72,0:23:54.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學想要做什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.97,0:23:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 我嗎？我啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:23:59.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:23:59.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:03.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是英雄少女！Cure prism登場!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:03.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl　                 稜鏡愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:49.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.49,0:01:55.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:02:00.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.63,0:02:08.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.55,0:02:13.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:17.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:19.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.23,0:02:23.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:28.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:30.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:34.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:38.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:42.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:42.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.42,0:02:44.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:49.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:54.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:59.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:04.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:07.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:15.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.02,0:22:29.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.69,0:22:34.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.45,0:22:37.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.03,0:22:38.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:41.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.71,0:22:44.17,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.17,0:22:46.13,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.13,0:22:48.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:51.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:53.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:55.93,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:23:02.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:08.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:10.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:15.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:19.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.28,0:23:25.37,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.46,0:23:29.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.63,0:23:33.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:37.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.50,0:23:38.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.89,0:23:41.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
